# Canonical origin, no trailing slash. Every canonical URL, hreflang alternate,
# sitemap entry, OG URL and JSON-LD @id is built from this.
#
# Leave it unset in production: src/lib/site.ts resolves to
# https://www.saudienergynews.com unless VERCEL_ENV says the build is a preview.
# Do NOT set it to a Vercel deployment URL — those are behind deployment
# protection, and a sitemap full of them is unfetchable by every crawler.
#
# Set it only to point a build somewhere else — a staging host, or local
# development that needs realistic absolute URLs.
#
# Changing the production origin after the site is indexed means a full
# re-index, so treat it as fixed.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=http://localhost:3000
